<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">- Ndwewe Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya ndatu lya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Yhn</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya ndatu lya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohane</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongoleho</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba lya 3 lya Yohane likityekwa na Nndumilwa Yohane mu u ngungwa ya 90 mbole ya kubhelekwa kwa Yesu Kilisito. Yohane kangulimanyiha ng'obhe handa ndo ywakatyekite lihamba ali, peni kihyengo kyake kangulikema nng'ohi kilongohi kipalamande kya 3 Yohana 1:1. Kangulongela hilahila mu kitabho kya 2 Yohane kipalamande kya 1:1. Yinguhwachilwa kukita Yohane kakityeka mahamba mandatu gha Nhalo ghwa Maha handa 1 Yohane na 2Yohane na 3Yohane manjubha Yohane pakabheghite kangutama ku kitami kya ku Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohane kakityeka lihamba ali kwa Gayo mundu ywakabheghite kangunhyubhalila Kilisto ywakakemitwe Gayo. kangummanyiha Gayo handa ghanja ghwake na kunnaghila Gayo kabhatekulo maha bhandu bhaanhyubhalila Kilisito, bhaabheghite mu mwanja kupitila kitami kyakatamite Gayo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaabheghite.</para>
  <para style="io">Yohane kangulikambuha lihamba lyake kipalamande kya (1:1).</para>
  <para style="io">Mbole kangunnyonjokeha mwoyo Gayo pakannubhulila kabhonehe utekulo kwa bhandu bhaanhyubhalila Kilisito kipalamande kya (1:2-8).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi, kanguaaghombela bhandu abhili, bhene ndo Diotelefe na Demetilio kipalamande kya (1:9-12).</para>
  <para style="io">Kuuhiko kanguyomolela lihamba lyake kipalamande kya (1:13-14).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Lihamba ali linguhuma kwa nenga nng'ohi kilongohi ghwa bhandu bha anhyubhalilite Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:1">Kwa ghanja ghwa nenga Gayo, ghunughupalite mu hoto.<verse eid="3JN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Ghanja ghwangu mpalo, nunguyupa kukita ghughendelele maha kwa ghoha mu ubhumi ghwako, Nungukuyupila mmili ghwako ghubhegha maha handa paghughenelela maha mu kubhegha papamu na Chapanga. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Nikiyelelwa munu pala amoo bha alongo paahikite apa na kutulubhulila yakya bhula ghungughendelela kuyitikila hoto na bhula paghughendelela kutama mu hoto ahyo. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Kahone kilibhi kindendite nnyelelwi munu handa kuyihwa kukita bhana bhangu bhangutama mu hoto.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohane kanguntika Gayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Ghanja ghwangu, ghwenga ghunguhyubhaliko munu kubhukana na kuatendela gha maha alongo bhako ahyubhalila, hata handa abhegha ahenja kwa ghwenga. <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />Bhakinongela nhalo ghwa upalo ghwa ghwenga muulongolo ghwa ngwemuko lya apa lya bhandu bha anhyubhalilite Kilisito. Peni chonde ghubhatangatile ngati aghendelele na mwanja ghwabhe handa payinnoghela Chapanga. <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />Kiyaha anguyanda mwanja ghwabhe kwakya lihengo lya Yesu kyangali kupeghwa kyohele kuhuma kwa bhandu bhaanhyubhalilite ng'obhe Kilisito. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />Hinu twenga bhatunhyubhalila Kilisto, tungunoghwa kuaatanga bhandu abho, ili na twenga tumokole kulilunga mu kutenda lihenga kwakya hoto.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Deotelefe na Demetilio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Nikiatyekela lihamba ali, ngwemuko lya bhandu bha anhyubhalilite Kilisito mihalo michoko, peni deotelefe, peni Deotelefe yunakilyakalyaka kya kubhegha kilongohi, kakilema kunnyihwa. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Hinu, panhika ndaghalongela milando yoha yakayitenda, malagho mahakata gha uhwangi ghakatughombela twenga. Hilahila mwene ghulema kuakingama alongo ahyubhalila abheghite mu mwanja, na kangi kanguakanikiha bhandu bhangi bhaapala kubhakingama na kuabhingabhinga panji ya ngwemuko ya bhandu bhaanhyubhalilite Kilisito.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Ghanja ghwangu, ghukotoke kughutughila nhwano nhakata, ngati lila liibheghite lya maha. Ywohele ywaatenda lya maha ndo ghwa Chapanga, na ywakatenda mahakata kakimmona ng'obhe Chapanga.<verse eid="3JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Bhandu bhoha bhanguntika Demetilio kwa ghala ghakaghatenda, na kangi hoto yene yinguntika. Na twenga tunguyobhela gha maha kunninga mwene, na ghwenga ghungumanya kukita kila kiitulongela ndo hoto.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majambuho gha kuyomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Ngali megha na matangalo gha kuaghombela peni mbala ng'obhe kughatyeka kwa kutumila lihamba. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Mbole yaki, ninguhyubhalila ndakubhona mbole ya manjubha machoko na twaalongela kibhungi kwa kibhungi.<verse eid="3JN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Ningukuyupila uhihimilo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:15">Aghanja bhako bha apa bhangukujambuha. Na ghwenga ghubhajambuhe aghanja bhetu bha akwo kila yumo kwa lihina lyaki.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>